\f0\fs24 \cf0 # Hospital Appointment Scheduler\
\
## Description\
This is a Python-based application designed to help hospital staff manage doctor appointments efficiently. It allows users to book appointments, view schedules, and cancel visits, ensuring no double-bookings occur.\
\
## Features\
* **Book Appointments:** Store patient details, doctor names, and time slots.\
* **Conflict Detection:** Automatically prevents booking the same doctor twice at the same time.\
* **Management:** View all appointments or filter them by date.\
* **Cancellation:** Remove appointments easily.\
\
## Tech Stack\
* **Language:** Python 3\
* **Libraries:** Standard Library only (No external dependencies)\
\
## How to Run\
1. Navigate to the introduction to problem solving folder: `cd src`\
2. Run the application: `python hospital.py`}